<!--
  A feed that is alive, well-formed, and carries nothing.

  This is the failure HTTP cannot see. The server answers 200, the parser is
  happy, and the pipeline counts the feed as read - so a source that has been
  silent for a month looks identical to a source that is working. Eight real
  feeds sat in exactly this state before anything measured it.
-->
